        "parts": [
          {
            "text": "Perfecto. Aquí tienes la consulta SQL para BigQuery que calcula los parámetros estadísticos descriptivos (fecha promedio, dispersión y cuartiles) de las fechas de inicio de los períodos de observación médica, utilizando la tabla `observation_period`:\n\n```sql\nSELECT\n    COUNT(t.observation_period_start_date) AS total_records,\n    DATE_FROM_UNIX_DATE(CAST(AVG(UNIX_DATE(t.observation_period_start_date)) AS INT64)) AS average_start_date,\n    CAST(STDDEV(UNIX_DATE(t.observation_period_start_date)) AS FLOAT64) AS stddev_start_date_in_days,\n    DATE_FROM_UNIX_DATE(CAST(APPROX_QUANTILES(UNIX_DATE(t.observation_period_start_date), 4)[OFFSET(1)] AS INT64)) AS q1_start_date,\n    DATE_FROM_UNIX_DATE(CAST(APPROX_QUANTILES(UNIX_DATE(t.observation_period_start_date), 4)[OFFSET(2)] AS INT64)) AS median_start_date,\n    DATE_FROM_UNIX_DATE(CAST(APPROX_QUANTILES(UNIX_DATE(t.observation_period_start_date), 4)[OFFSET(3)] AS INT64)) AS q3_start_date\nFROM\n    `observation_period` AS t\n```",
